Save captured maidens to build your ultimate battle harem with synergistic team buffs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <i>Gold Obsession</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to empower characters and unlock secret content - your key to dungeon domination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <i>Progression Depth</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade stats, unlock meta-skills, and evolve combat styles through each rebirth cycle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 <i>Mystic Relics</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss drops grant game-breaking combos. Stack modifiers to become unstoppable!</p>",
